 "headline": "Top negative topics in November 2025: General help request, Duplicate charge, Paid but service not delivered, Feature not working, Login / account locked.",
 "answer": "239 of 682 conversations in November 2025 were negative (35.0%). Ranked by number of negative conversations, the top 5 topics are General help request (49), Duplicate charge (42), Paid but service not delivered (30), Feature not working (28), Login / account locked (24). General help request accounts for 20.5% of negative conversations. By negative rate rather than count, Duplicate charge is highest at 48.3% (95% CI 38.1%\u201358.6%).",
 "key_points": [
  "#1 General help request: 49 negative of 156 (31.4%, 95% CI 24.6%\u201339.1%)",
  "#2 Duplicate charge: 42 negative of 87 (48.3%, 95% CI 38.1%\u201358.6%)",
  "#3 Paid but service not delivered: 30 negative of 75 (40.0%, 95% CI 29.7%\u201351.3%)",
  "#4 Feature not working: 28 negative of 76 (36.8%, 95% CI 26.9%\u201348.1%)",
  "#5 Login / account locked: 24 negative of 58 (41.4%, 95% CI 29.6%\u201354.2%)"
 ],
